xv (6.0.4-2~noble) noble; urgency=medium

  * Added lazy window creation optimizations (reduced startup windows from ~140 to ~20)
  * Fixed -nolimits flag to work with modern window managers (Gnome/Mutter)
  * Added comprehensive test suite for optimizations
  * Documented Muffin compositor limitation with oversized windows
  * Merged GitHub (optimizations) and GitLab (packaging) branches
  * Updated VCS URLs to GitHub

 -- Lene Preuss <lene.preuss@gmail.com>  Fri, 21 Nov 2025 09:36:28 +0100

xv (6.0.4-1~noble) noble; urgency=medium

  * New upstream version 6.0.4 from jasper-software/xv
  * Migrated to jasper-software/xv fork (actively maintained)
  * Updated for Ubuntu 24.04 (Noble Numbat)
  * Switched to CMake build system
  * Uses modern system libraries (libpng 1.6, zlib 1.3)
  * Removed static linking of old zlib/libpng
  * Added support for: PNG, JPEG, TIFF, XRandR
  * Fixed libpng 1.5+ compatibility issues
  * Added HiDPI support
  * Fixed JPEG crash bugs
  * Updated dependencies to current Ubuntu packages

 -- Lene Preuss <lene.preuss@gmail.com>  Thu, 24 Oct 2025 18:30:00 +0000

